        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decktoon</strong> is a strategic card game inspired by the most iconic symbols of Brazilian comics! Developed by Funktoon — the largest platform for reading Brazilian comics — the game throws you into electrifying duels where each card represents legendary characters, memorable scenes, narrative twists, and moments of pure emotion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⚔️ Objective:</strong> Build your deck, unleash your creativity, and dominate the board with smart plays and surprises only comics can deliver. Every match is unique, testing your tactical skills and ability to read your opponent.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🕹️ Gameplay Overview</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a themed deck made up of characters, scenes, and twists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use creativity points to summon cards, strategize, and respond to your opponent’s moves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character cards</strong> form the core of combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scene cards</strong> shift the pace of the match with special effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Twist cards</strong> can flip the game upside down at the right moment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory goes to the player who balances attack, defense, and storytelling.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🌟 Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🃏 100% Brazilian-themed card game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ Cards include characters, scenes, and twists for emotional and surprising gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ Strategic creativity system where every decision matters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔄 Fast-paced matches, great for both beginners and veterans</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 Celebrates Brazilian comics with art and symbols honoring major works and artists</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to duel, surprise, and prove you're the true master of comics in <strong>Decktoon</strong>! 🚀</p>",
